invariant: INV-46
file: mlkem_lanes.h
catches: test/docker-aes-runtime-qemu.sh mlkem-vector
reason: the SSE2 Barrett reduction shifts without adding 2^9 first, so
  its quotient rounds down where mlk_barrett_reduce rounds to the
  nearest. Only an x86-64 compiler reads the line, so the script builds
  bin/mlkem_vector_equiv_test for x86-64 and runs it under
  qemu-x86_64. The lane skips without docker, and this then reports
  unguarded rather than caught.

--- old
    lanes t = _mm_srai_epi16(_mm_add_epi16(x, _mm_set1_epi16(512)), 10);
--- new
    lanes t = _mm_srai_epi16(_mm_add_epi16(x, _mm_set1_epi16(0)), 10);
